&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is seeking a strategic and forward-thinking &lt;strong&gt;Lead Compensation Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt; to take the lead in developing, implementing, and successfully integrating our global compensation programs. We need a standout professional who can think outside conventional frameworks - utilizing deep insights, unlock pay transparency, and establishing strong business partnerships to drive exceptional results. This position plays a vital role in ensuring our rewards structures effectively incentivize and motivate our global workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Global Director of Compensation Strategy, this high-impact, visible position is central to aligning our rewards initiatives with HelloFresh’s core pay philosophy, fostering our growth objectives, maintaining market competitiveness, and guaranteeing absolute pay compliance. You will play a foundational role in defining our gl

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of Leads &amp;amp; Prospects in New York, you will be a part of the strategy team, supporting global marketing leadership, shaping how HelloFresh Group engages, nurtures, and converts prospective customers across 17 markets and six brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for identification and collection of communication consents from leads arriving from acquisition channels. You will actively collaborate with our Product team, to ensure a smooth and customer friendly experience, as well as legal compliance. Once leads are “captured” you will collaborate with the lifecycle team on conceptualization, personalization and localization of global lifecycle journeys for leads and prospects across all communication channels. Working within a distributed, international team across multiple time zones, you will play a key role in aligning strategy and execution globally.&lt;/p&gt;
